### Create claim
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "polNbr": "POL000000001",
  "custId": 1001,
  "lossDate": "2026-04-01",
  "claimType": "PRP",
  "description": "FNOL from storm damage"
}

### Get claim detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/claims/{{claimNbr}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create reserve
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/claims/{{claimNbr}}/reserves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reserveType": "PRO",
  "approvedAmt": 5000.00
}

### Create approval (supervisor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/claims/{{claimNbr}}/approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reserveId": 1
}

### Initiate payment (adjuster)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/claims/{{claimNbr}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reserveId": 1,
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "payeeId": 1001
}

### Add note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/claims/{{claimNbr}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noteText": "Adjuster site visit completed."
}
